    "\\(who.prefix(1).uppercased() + who.dropFirst()) was signed without the “Network Extensions” permission, so iOS will not run Porthole's own tunnel. You do not need it: use LocalDevVPN instead (turn on “Use LocalDevVPN instead” in Settings › JIT and connection, and switch LocalDevVPN on before you press Play)\\(usingLocalDev ? ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\\(who.prefix(1).uppercased() + who.dropFirst()) was signed without the “Network Extensions” permission, so iOS will not run Porthole's own tunnel. You do not need it: use LocalDevVPN instead (turn on “Use LocalDevVPN instead” in Settings › JIT and connection, and switch LocalDevVPN on before you press Play)\\(usingLocalDev ? "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\\(who.prefix(1).uppercased() + who.dropFirst()) 在签名时没有“Network Extensions”权限，因此 iOS 不会运行 Porthole 自带的隧道。你不需要它：改用 LocalDevVPN 即可（在“设置 › JIT 和连接”中打开“改用 LocalDevVPN”，并在点按“开始游戏”之前打开 LocalDevVPN）\\(usingLocalDev ? "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A comment is shown to others only after it has been approved. Your thumb counts at once. Rating again replaces your earlier rating.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A comment is shown to others only after it has been approved. Your thumb counts at once. Rating again replaces your earlier rating."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "评论只有在通过审核后才会向其他人显示。你的点赞会立即计入。再次评分会替换你之前的评分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A copy you can change. It is not used until you pick it.": {
      "localizations": {
