          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光盘或安装文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few quick steps before games can run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A few quick steps before games can run."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏运行前需要完成几个快速步骤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A file for a chat or the Files app": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A file for a chat or the Files app"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于聊天或“文件”App 的文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A frame capture is for bug reports: it is taken a moment after the menu closes. The profile looks 200 times a second at what every busy thread is doing, names the busiest game modules and functions and writes them to the log; it slows the game a little while it runs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A frame capture is for bug reports: it is taken a moment after the menu closes. The profile looks 200 times a second at what every busy thread is doing, names the busiest game modules and functions and writes them to the log; it slows the game a little while it runs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帧捕获用于提交错误报告：它会在菜单关闭片刻后拍摄。性能分析会以每秒 200 次的频率查看每个繁忙线程正在做的事情，找出最繁忙的游戏模块和函数，并将它们写入日志；运行期间会让游戏稍微变慢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A free app; nothing to allow in Porthole": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A free app; nothing to allow in Porthole"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免费 App；无需在 Porthole 中允许任何内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game ended unexpectedly": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A game ended unexpectedly"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏意外结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game is running and holds your Steam sign-in. Close the game first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A game is running and holds your Steam sign-in. Close the game first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有游戏正在运行并占用你的 Steam 登录。先关闭游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game is running and holds your Steam sign-in. Close the game, then come back here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A game is running and holds your Steam sign-in. Close the game, then come back here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有游戏正在运行并占用你的 Steam 登录。关闭游戏，然后返回这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game's page": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A game's page"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏页面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A game's Steam buttons (Workshop, Store) and Shift+Tab ask for Steam's overlay, which cannot draw here and would leave the game not answering. With this on, this menu opens instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A game's Steam buttons (Workshop, Store) and Shift+Tab ask for Steam's overlay, which cannot draw here and would leave the game not answering. With this on, this menu opens instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏的 Steam 按钮（创意工坊、商店）和 Shift+Tab 会请求 Steam 覆盖界面，该界面无法在此处绘制，并会导致游戏无响应。打开此选项后，会改为打开此菜单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A link outside Porthole asked to start this game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A link outside Porthole asked to start this game."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Porthole 外部的链接请求启动此游戏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pack made for your exact GPU and system version is not published yet. When it is, it shows here instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A pack made for your exact GPU and system version is not published yet. When it is, it shows here instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未发布适用于你的确切 GPU 和系统版本的软件包。发布后，它会改为显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A picture between the game’s frames, made with your copy of Lossless Scaling. Direct3D 11 and 12 games (12 needs more memory). The passes use graphics power, so the game itself runs slower: the screen shows more frames, but not double. The first seconds stutter while the shaders are prepared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A picture between the game’s frames, made with your copy of Lossless Scaling. Direct3D 11 and 12 games (12 needs more memory). The passes use graphics power, so the game itself runs slower: the screen shows more frames, but not double. The first seconds stutter while the shaders are prepared."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用你的 Lossless Scaling 副本在游戏帧之间生成的一张画面。适用于 Direct3D 11 和 12 游戏（12 需要更多内存）。这些处理会占用图形性能，因此游戏本身运行更慢：屏幕显示的帧数更多，但不会翻倍。着色器准备期间，最初几秒会出现卡顿。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A QR code signs in without this app ever seeing your password. If you type your password instead, it is encrypted before it leaves the device and is never saved. Only a sign-in token is kept, in this device's Keychain. Porthole is unofficial and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Valve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A QR code signs in without this app ever seeing your password. If you type your password instead, it is encrypted before it leaves the device and is never saved. Only a sign-in token is kept, in this device's Keychain. Porthole is unofficial and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Valve."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "二维码登录无需此 App 接触你的密码。如果你改为输入密码，密码会在离开设备前加密，且永远不会保存。只有登录令牌会保存在此设备的钥匙串中。Porthole 是非官方应用，与 Valve 没有关联，也未获得 Valve 的认可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A row that says Default follows Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A row that says Default follows Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示“默认”的行会跟随设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A setup is a “.\\(GameSetupShare.fileExtension)” file or one line of text that starts with “porthole-setup1:”, made with Share this game's setup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A setup is a “.\\(GameSetupShare.fileExtension)” file or one line of text that starts with “porthole-setup1:”, made with Share this game's setup."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装配置是一个“.\\(GameSetupShare.fileExtension)”文件，或以“porthole-setup1:”开头的一行文本，通过“分享此游戏的配置”创建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short report helps other people with your device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A short report helps other people with your device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "简短的报告有助于使用相同设备的其他人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stick takes a touch near its place and puts its base where your thumb lands, so you do not have to find the circle. Not while you edit the layout.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A stick takes a touch near its place and puts its base where your thumb lands, so you do not have to find the circle. Not while you edit the layout."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "摇杆会接收其位置附近的触摸，并将底座放在拇指落下的位置，因此你无需寻找圆圈。编辑布局时除外。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
