    "EA games download straight from EA's servers. Games that use EA's kernel anti-cheat (Battlefield 2042 and later, EA SPORTS FC, Madden) cannot run here. Cloud saves, friends and EA's in-game overlay are not supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "EA games download straight from EA's servers. Games that use EA's kernel anti-cheat (Battlefield 2042 and later, EA SPORTS FC, Madden) cannot run here. Cloud saves, friends and EA's in-game overlay are not supported."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "EA 游戏直接从 EA 的服务器下载。使用 EA 内核级反作弊的游戏（Battlefield 2042 及之后作品、EA SPORTS FC、Madden）无法在此运行。不支持云存档、好友和 EA 游戏内覆盖界面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
