    "Eco puts the game on the efficiency cores: cooler and longer battery, slower. GPU sync only matters if you see flicker or a freeze.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eco puts the game on the efficiency cores: cooler and longer battery, slower. GPU sync only matters if you see flicker or a freeze."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "节能模式会让游戏在能效核心上运行：更凉爽、续航更长，但速度较慢。GPU 同步仅在出现闪烁或冻结时才重要。"
          }
        }
