    "It goes to Porthole's server and is private: only the maintainer can read it, and you can follow what happens to it here. What is in it is what “Look at exactly what would be shared” shows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It goes to Porthole's server and is private: only the maintainer can read it, and you can follow what happens to it here. What is in it is what “Look at exactly what would be shared” shows."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它会发送到 Porthole 的服务器，且为私密内容：只有维护者可以阅读，你可以在这里跟踪它的处理进度。它的内容就是“查看具体会共享哪些内容”中所显示的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
