    "itch.io games are plain downloads: Porthole fetches the game's Windows file, unpacks it, and finds its program. Games that are made for a web browser are not listed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "itch.io games are plain downloads: Porthole fetches the game's Windows file, unpacks it, and finds its program. Games that are made for a web browser are not listed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "itch.io 游戏为普通下载：Porthole 会获取游戏的 Windows 文件、解包并找到其程序。为网页浏览器制作的游戏不会列出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "itch.io lets you make a personal API key. Porthole uses it only to list your games and download them; it stays in this device's Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "itch.io lets you make a personal API key. Porthole uses it only to list your games and download them; it stays in this device's Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "itch.io 允许你创建个人 API 密钥。Porthole 仅使用它来列出你的游戏并下载它们；它会保存在此设备的钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "itch.io lets you make a personal API key; Porthole uses it only to list the games you own or claimed and to download them. The key stays in this device's Keychain. Games you own that have a Windows download are listed here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "itch.io lets you make a personal API key; Porthole uses it only to list the games you own or claimed and to download them. The key stays in this device's Keychain. Games you own that have a Windows download are listed here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "itch.io 允许你创建个人 API 密钥；Porthole 仅使用它来列出你拥有或已领取的游戏并下载它们。密钥会保存在此设备的钥匙串中。你拥有的、提供 Windows 下载的游戏会列在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
