    "Runs \\(prerequisite.name), the game's own setup, once in Porthole's Windows. Most games start without it; try this if one reports a missing runtime.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs \\(prerequisite.name), the game's own setup, once in Porthole's Windows. Most games start without it; try this if one reports a missing runtime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Porthole 的 Windows 中运行一次 \\(prerequisite.name)，即游戏自带的安装程序。大多数游戏无需此步即可启动；如果某款游戏提示缺少运行时，请尝试此项。"
          }
        }
