    "Sent: your device model, iOS and app version, the version of the game engine (\\(CompatEngine.label)), the answers above, and the game's log (private: only the developer reads it, and it is cleaned of personal paths and account names). Not sent: your name or any account. Every report is checked before it appears in Reports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sent: your device model, iOS and app version, the version of the game engine (\\(CompatEngine.label)), the answers above, and the game's log (private: only the developer reads it, and it is cleaned of personal paths and account names). Not sent: your name or any account. Every report is checked before it appears in Reports."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送内容：你的设备型号、iOS 和应用版本、游戏引擎版本（\\(CompatEngine.label)）、上述回答，以及游戏日志（私密：仅开发者可查看，且已清除个人路径和账户名称）。不会发送：你的姓名或任何账户。每份报告在出现在报告中之前都会经过检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
