    "Swipe in from the right edge of the screen to open this menu, and swipe it back to the right to close it. The pencil and keyboard buttons fade along with the handle (Hidden dims them like Fades out) and light up when touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe in from the right edge of the screen to open this menu, and swipe it back to the right to close it. The pencil and keyboard buttons fade along with the handle (Hidden dims them like Fades out) and light up when touched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从屏幕右边缘向内滑动以打开此菜单，向右滑回以关闭它。铅笔和键盘按钮会随手柄一起淡出（“隐藏”会像“淡出”一样让它们变暗），触摸时会亮起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe the menu back to the right, or tap outside it, to close it. With a controller: hold \\(padKind.menuChordName) to open it, the D-pad to move, \\(padKind.glyph(": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
