    "Which button the game sees when you press each one on the controller. Pick what a button should do instead; to swap two buttons, change both. This works while the controller is an Xbox or DualSense pad for the game, not in keyboard-and-mouse mode (use Controller buttons there). Hold Menu + View for half a second still opens the Porthole menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which button the game sees when you press each one on the controller. Pick what a button should do instead; to swap two buttons, change both. This works while the controller is an Xbox or DualSense pad for the game, not in keyboard-and-mouse mode (use Controller buttons there). Hold Menu + View for half a second still opens the Porthole menu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当你按下手柄上的每个按钮时，游戏会识别为哪个按钮。选择按钮应执行的操作；要交换两个按钮，请同时更改两者。当手柄以 Xbox 或 DualSense 手柄模式为游戏工作时此功能有效，在键盘和鼠标模式下无效（请在那里使用手柄按钮）。按住 Menu + View 半秒仍可打开 Porthole 菜单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
