          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You left the app for a moment. If the percentage below does not move, tap Cancel and start the update again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You left the app for a moment. If the percentage below does not move, tap Cancel and start the update again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你短暂离开了 App。如果下方百分比没有变化，请点击取消并重新开始更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You sign in on Amazon's own page. The sign-in token stays in this device's Keychain; Porthole never sees your password. The games you bought on Amazon or claimed with Prime Gaming are listed here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You sign in on Amazon's own page. The sign-in token stays in this device's Keychain; Porthole never sees your password. The games you bought on Amazon or claimed with Prime Gaming are listed here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在 Amazon 自己的页面上登录。登录令牌保存在此设备的 Keychain 中；Porthole 永远不会看到你的密码。你在 Amazon 上购买或通过 Prime Gaming 领取的游戏会列在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You sign in on EA's own page. The sign-in token stays in this device's Keychain; Porthole never sees your password. The PC games on your EA account are listed here, and Porthole starts them without the EA app: it asks EA for each game's licence itself and answers the game's questions the way the EA app would.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You sign in on EA's own page. The sign-in token stays in this device's Keychain; Porthole never sees your password. The PC games on your EA account are listed here, and Porthole starts them without the EA app: it asks EA for each game's licence itself and answers the game's questions the way the EA app would."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在 EA 自己的页面上登录。登录令牌保存在此设备的 Keychain 中；Porthole 永远不会看到你的密码。你 EA 账户上的 PC 游戏会列在这里，Porthole 无需 EA App 即可启动它们：它会自行向 EA 请求每款游戏的许可证，并以 EA App 的方式回答游戏的问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You sign in on Epic's own page. The sign-in token stays in this device's Keychain; Porthole never sees your password. Your games that have a Windows version are listed here, and install straight from Epic's servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You sign in on Epic's own page. The sign-in token stays in this device's Keychain; Porthole never sees your password. Your games that have a Windows version are listed here, and install straight from Epic's servers."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在 Epic 自己的页面上登录。登录令牌保存在此设备的 Keychain 中；Porthole 永远不会看到你的密码。你拥有的具有 Windows 版本的游戏会列在这里，并直接从 Epic 的服务器安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You sign in on GOG's own page. The sign-in token stays in this device's Keychain; Porthole never sees your password. Your games that have a Windows version are listed here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You sign in on GOG's own page. The sign-in token stays in this device's Keychain; Porthole never sees your password. Your games that have a Windows version are listed here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在 GOG 自己的页面上登录。登录令牌保存在此设备的 Keychain 中；Porthole 永远不会看到你的密码。你拥有的具有 Windows 版本的游戏会列在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've played \\(minutes) min. Play for at least \\(CompatRules.minMinutesForWorking) minutes to report that it works; a game that won't start can be reported at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've played \\(minutes) min. Play for at least \\(CompatRules.minMinutesForWorking) minutes to report that it works; a game that won't start can be reported at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已玩了 \\(minutes) 分钟。至少玩 \\(CompatRules.minMinutesForWorking) 分钟才能报告运行正常；无法启动的游戏可随时报告。"
          }
        }
